Subject: [PATCH 42/73] drivers-irqchip: carry downstream 4.19.325 vendor delta
 onto v5.15.220

Ported mechanically by upstream-port/bin/portclassify.py from:
  Zenium_Kernel 4.19.325 (MTK/OPLUS downstream, squashed snapshot)

3 file(s) in this group.  Every hunk was applied only where its pre-image
